  "technical_contribution": "The research develops a novel GNN architecture that integrates dynamic ontology generation with Large Language Models (LLMs), creating a hybrid model that significantly improves interpretability and computational efficiency compared to existing GNN-LLM integration approaches. This technical advancement allows for real-time adaptation to evolving knowledge in scientific literature.",
  "empirical_contribution": "Through rigorous empirical validation, the study provides new insights into the effectiveness of the proposed GNN-LLM model, measuring its performance against traditional document classification methods using metrics such as Matthews Correlation Coefficient (MCC) and F1-score. The findings reveal substantial improvements in model accuracy and interpretability, addressing current limitations in the field.",
